<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - C.BANK ASSETS, RESERVE MONEY UP IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - C.BANK ASSETS, RESERVE MONEY UP IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's central bank said on Friday that its reserve money rose by 114.7 million litas in March to 2.4598 billion litas.</p>
<p>The bank also said in a statement that its foreign assets in March rose by 75.7 million litas to 3.2637 billion litas from 3.188 billion litas.</p>
<p>The bank's total assets in the month climbed to 3.6648 billion litas from 3.5553 billion litas.</p>
<p>--Ed Stoddard, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
